  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-navy pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Intuitive Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ee/The_Flash_Clifford_DeVoe_Thinker.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200404182821\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The Flash Clifford DeVoe Thinker\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ee/The_Flash_Clifford_DeVoe_Thinker.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200404182821\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ee/The_Flash_Clifford_DeVoe_Thinker.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200404182821 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ee/The_Flash_Clifford_DeVoe_Thinker.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20200404182821 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The Flash Clifford DeVoe Thinker\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_Flash_Clifford_DeVoe_Thinker.jpg\" data-image-name=\"The Flash Clifford DeVoe Thinker.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Thinker (Arrowverse/The Flash) could instinctively excel with his absorbed powers and wield them to a greater degree than their original owner.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb the powers of others and intuitively know how to use them.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb the powers of others and intuitively know how to use them.</b> Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Aptitude\" title=\"Intuitive Aptitude\">Intuitive Aptitude</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Replication\" title=\"Intuitive Replication\">Intuitive Replication</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Intuitive Power/Ability Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb the powers of others and immediately know how to use them,&#160;allowing them to possibly have much more control over the absorbed power than the original user. It is also possible that the user will also be much stronger than the original user, being able to do things with the power that the original holder couldn't.\n</p><p>An example of this would be: If the user absorbed <a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Manipulation\" title=\"Electricity Manipulation\">Electricity Manipulation</a>, the user would understand electricity's connection to <a href=\"/wiki/Magnetism_Manipulation\" title=\"Magnetism Manipulation\">magnetism</a>, allowing the user to gain the full power of <a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Manipulation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Manipulation\">Electromagnetism Manipulation</a>. Furthermore, the user would also realized Electromagnetism becomes one with <a href=\"/wiki/Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Weak Force Manipulation\">Weak Force</a> at higher energies, leading to <a href=\"/wiki/Electro-Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Electro-Weak Force Manipulation\">Electro-Weak Force Manipulation</a>. \n</p><p>Another example is: If the user absorbs <a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Manipulation\">Kinetic Energy Manipulation</a>, the user would understand thermal energy’s connection to other energies, allowing the user to gain the full power of <a href=\"/wiki/Rotational_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Rotational Energy Manipulation\">Rotational Energy Manipulation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Manipulation\" title=\"Sound Manipulation\">Sound Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Manipulation\" title=\"Thermal Manipulation\">Thermal Manipulation</a>. It would also allow for <a href=\"/wiki/Intangibility\" title=\"Intangibility\">Intangibility</a>, use it for <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Regeneration\" title=\"Energy Regeneration\">regeneration</a> and much more.\n</p><p>With the correct power, <a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Warping\" title=\"Reality Warping\">Reality Warping</a> can be achieved.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Intuition\" title=\"Ability Intuition\">Ability Intuition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Mastering\" title=\"Ability Mastering\">Ability Mastering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Aptitude\" title=\"Intuitive Aptitude\">Intuitive Aptitude</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Omni-Absorption\">Omni-Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May possess the same limits as someone with <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a>.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Singularity\" title=\"Singularity\">Singularity</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption_Immunity\" title=\"Power Absorption Immunity\">Power Absorption Immunity</a> are immune.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://arrow.fandom.com/wiki/Clifford_DeVoe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:arrow:Clifford DeVoe\">Clifford DeVoe/The Thinker</a> (<i>Arrowverse/The Flash 2014</i>)</li>\n<li>Casey Krinsky (<i>DC Superhero Girls 2019</i>)</li>\n<li>All For One (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntuitive_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:141px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"The_Flash_4x22_-_The_Thinker_storms_the_A-R-G-U-S-_Castle-2\" style=\"position: relative; height:139px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox video video-thumbnail xsmall\" href=\"/wiki/File:The_Flash_4x22_-_The_Thinker_storms_the_A.R.G.U.S._Castle-2\" title=\"The Flash 4x22 - The Thinker storms the A.R.G.U.S. Castle-2 (7 KB)\" style=\"height:139px; width:185px;\"><span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"><svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg></span><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/58/The_Flash_4x22_-_The_Thinker_storms_the_A.R.G.U.S._Castle-2/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250402005700\" title=\"The Flash 4x22 - The Thinker storms the A.R.G.U.S. Castle-2 (7 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"139\" width=\"185\" data-video-name=\"The Flash 4x22 - The Th